===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|zle-mru|козырекъ}} (att. 1630), from {{der|ru|zle-mru|козырь}}, further origin unclear. {{surf|ru|ко́зырь|-ёк}}. Akin to regional (Bialostok) {{cog|pl|kozyrek}}, but that is quite likely a Russian borrowing.

